# Dashboard design system

Canonical tokens live in `apps/dashboard/src/index.css`. Theme is `html[data-theme=light|dark]` (not `.dark`).

## Surface ladder (both themes)

| Token | Use for |
|-------|---------|
| `bg-bg` / `app-atmosphere` | App chrome / page canvas |
| `bg-bg-sidebar` | Rail / section nav |
| `bg-bg-canvas` | Rare; prefer surface for main sheets |
| `bg-bg-surface` | Cards, dialogs, main panels |
| `bg-bg-elevated` | Insets inside a surface (chips, sublists) |
| `bg-bg-hover` | Hover / selected rows |
| `bg-bg-input` | Form fields |

Light mode keeps **one shared gray canvas** (`bg` = `sidebar` = `canvas`) and reserves **white** for `surface`. Do not invent extra gray steps or multi-layer glows.

## The only card recipe

Use one of:

- React: `<Card>` / `<CardHeader>` / `<CardContent>` from `components/ui/card.tsx`
- CSS: `.panel`

Recipe: `bg-bg-surface` + `border border-border/60` + `rounded-xl` + `box-shadow: var(--shadow-card)`.

Inside a card: `.panel-inset` or `bg-bg-elevated` + `border-border/40` — **no second card shadow**.

Interactive cards: `<Card interactive>` or `.panel` + `.hover-lift`.

## Borders

- `/40` — soft dividers, table rows, card header lines
- `/60` — cards, dialogs, dropdowns (default)
- full `border-border` — strong input edges only when needed

## Elevation

| Class / token | When |
|---------------|------|
| `shadow-card` / `.panel` | Cards and shell sheets |
| `shadow-overlay` | Dialogs, popovers, command palette |
| `.btn-elevated` | Buttons (uses `--shadow-btn`) |
| `.shadow-inset-highlight` | Inputs, tab lists |
| `.shadow-chip-active` | Selected nav chips |

Do **not** hand-roll `shadow-xl` / `shadow-lg` / raw `rgba(255,255,255,…)` insets. Do **not** stack 3+ custom box-shadows for light mode.

## Buttons

Use `components/ui/button.tsx` variants only:

- Primary actions → `default` (accent)
- Secondary chrome → `secondary` / `outline` / `subtle`
- Quiet → `ghost`
- AI actions → `ai`

No one-off `bg-black`, `bg-text-heading`, or solid dark slabs for CTAs in light mode.

Header actions sit in `CardHeaderActions` as `Button variant="ghost" size="iconSm"`. `CardHeader` is always `h-11`. Do not put `size="sm"` labelled buttons in the header — they stretch the bar and misalign neighbouring cards.

## Radius nesting

`rounded-2xl` (shell) → `rounded-xl` (card) → `rounded-lg` (input/inner) → `rounded-md` (chip) → `rounded-full` (pill).

## Anti-patterns

- Duplicating the card string instead of `<Card>` / `.panel`
- Light-only special-case shadows or gradients on random pages
- Transparent `bg-bg-surface/80` without `backdrop-blur`
- Legacy: `bg-surface-raised`, `border-border-subtle`, `bg-surface-muted`
